/target
/dist

# Generated per-crate by cargo-cyclonedx during ci-compliance; the real
# artifacts are collected into dist/sbom/. Tracking one of them meant every
# compliance run re-dirtied the tree with a new UUID and timestamp.
sbom.json

# Recognizer model weights. 142MiB to 1.6GiB, downloaded per machine and
# pointed at with OUTLOUD_WHISPER_MODEL; committing one would dwarf the
# entire history.
#
# Root-anchored, so a deliberate test fixture under crates/ or tests/ is
# still trackable rather than silently invisible.
/*.bin

# Scratch audio and logs from verification runs on a real machine. The
# harnesses write these next to the repo, and they are per-run noise.
/*.wav
/outloud.log
